          hints: ['Same five steps as the forced-IVP lesson.', String.raw`Roots $-10 \pm 10i$: $Q = Q_p + e^{-10t}(C_1\cos 10t + C_2\sin 10t)$.`, String.raw`$Q(0) = 0.2 + C_1 = 0$; $Q'(0) = 4 + (-10C_1 + 10C_2) = 0$.`],
